#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Contacts, companies and your own details as .vcf cards, and a card file read in. Switched off, the downloads and the import are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Teagmhálaithe, cuideachtaí agus do shonraí féin mar chártaí .vcf, agus comhad cártaí a léamh isteach. Múchta, ní thairgtear na híoslódálacha ná an iompórtáil agus freagraíonn a seoltaí amhail is nach mbeadh aon rud ann."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "DOCX"
msgstr "DOCX"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Extend file formats"
msgstr "Formáidí comhaid breise"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "GeoJSON"
msgstr "GeoJSON"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "iCalendar"
msgstr "iCalendar"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "ODT"
msgstr "ODT"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Téacs OpenDocument: CV nó litir a íoslódáiltear mar chomhad .odt, agus téacs comhaid .odt a uaslódálann tú á choinneáil ionas gur féidir le cuardach é a aimsiú. Múchta, ní thairgtear an íoslódáil agus ní léitear téacs comhaid uaslódáilte."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Áiteanna na gcuideachtaí mar chomhad GeoJSON, amach, agus pointí a léitear isteach a chuireann seoladh cuideachta in áit de láimh nuair a bheidh tic curtha agat leo. Teastaíonn Léarscáileanna uaidh. Múchta, ní thairgtear ceachtar acu agus freagraíonn a seoltaí amhail is nach mbeadh aon rud ann."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "Na formáidí comhaid is féidir le Postulo a léamh agus a scríobh seachas a fhormáid féin: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard agus Europass. Is é seo an lasc dóibh go léir le chéile; is féidir gach ceann acu a mhúchadh ina aonar fós fad atá sé seo ar siúl, seachas PDF. Múchta, ní thairgtear aon rud sna formáidí sin agus ní scriostar aon rud: fanann na comhaid atá agat, agus na sonraí as ar rinneadh iad."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "An fhormáid ina ndéantar CV agus litir: clibeáilte, ionas gur féidir le léitheoir scáileáin é a léamh. Ar siúl i gcónaí; níl aon rud eile ag Postulo a bheadh fós ina CV."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Cáipéisí Word: CV nó litir a íoslódáiltear mar chomhad .docx, agus téacs comhaid .docx a uaslódálann tú á choinneáil ionas gur féidir le cuardach é a aimsiú. Múchta, ní thairgtear an íoslódáil agus ní léitear téacs comhaid uaslódáilte."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "D'fhéilire mar chomhaid agus fothaí .ics, agus comhad féilire a léamh isteach. Múchta, ní thairgtear na híoslódálacha, an iompórtáil ná na fothaí agus freagraíonn a seoltaí amhail is nach mbeadh aon rud ann; freagraíonn siad arís, ag an seoladh céanna, nuair a chuirtear ar siúl é."
